OL,5,G1400 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FPolice endeavours to tackle drunk
OL,7,     For drug drivers. Police control
OL,8,     Freceives reports of suspected drug
OL,9,     Fdriver. After the driver fails to
OL,10,     Fstop, cops are forced into a
OL,11,     Fhigh-speed pursuit.
OL,12,G1500 Traffic Cops
OL,13,     FFollowing police facing the daily
OL,14,     Fchallenge of catching car thieves
OL,15,     Fas organised gangs use high-tech
OL,16,     Fscanners to hack into keyless
OL,17,     Fcars, allowing them to quickly
OL,18,     Fsteal a car.
