OL,5,G0000 Fatal First Dates
OL,6,     FA teen thought she was chatting to
OL,7,     Fthe boy of her dreams, but the guy
OL,8,     Fshe believed was 17, was really a
OL,9,     F47-year-old man grooming her
OL,10,     Fbefore kidnapping her - with fatal
OL,11,     Fconsequences.
OL,12,G0100 Acts of Murder
